diff --git a/arm_wiki/Movie-selection.md b/arm_wiki/Movie-selection.md
index 8eb60d3..9b032b3 100644
--- a/arm_wiki/Movie-selection.md
+++ b/arm_wiki/Movie-selection.md
@@ -76,3 +76,11 @@ The job-detail page also accepts an existing non-series waiting job whose flag
 was omitted by the earlier release. Controls remain disabled once submitted or
 outside waiting; series UI behavior is unchanged. Authentication and CSRF remain
 required. This fixes form visibility, not metadata credentials or classification.
+
+## Testing the wait
+
+MOVIE_SELECTION_WAIT_SECONDS is an integer5..1800, default1800. Set60 for
+movie-selection testing. Movie waits poll every5seconds against a monotonic
+deadline; timeout stops without selecting or ripping. TV waits are unchanged.
+This is separate from MANUAL_WAIT_TIME (identification/MakeMKV scheduling).
+Configuration is captured by the job process; it cannot change an active wait.
diff --git a/setup/arm.yaml b/setup/arm.yaml
